```LC-004 SSH brute force (Linux) | MITRE T1110.001 | Data: /var/log/auth.log (sourcetype linux_secure) | Schedule: */10 * * * *, last 10 min | Throttle 60m by src```
index=linux sourcetype=linux_secure "Failed password"
| rex "Failed password for (invalid user )?(?<user>\S+) from (?<src>\S+)"
| bin _time span=10m
| stats count AS failures dc(user) AS users values(user) AS targeted BY _time, src, host
| where failures >= 10 OR users >= 5
